Theborder-widthproperty specifies the width of the four borders.

The width can be set as a specific size (in px, pt, cm, em, etc) or by using 
one of the three pre-defined values: thin, medium, or thick:

Theborder-widthproperty can have from one to four values (for the top border, right border, 
bottom border, and the left border):

### Code Snippets

```
p.one
{
border-style: solid;
border-width: 5px;
}
p.two
{
border-style: solid;
border-width: medium;
}
p.three
{
border-style: dotted;
border-width: 2px;
}
p.four
{
border-style: dotted;
border-width: thick;
}

---

p.one {
border-style: solid;
border-width: 5px 20px; /* 
  5px top and bottom, 20px on the sides */
}
p.two {
border-style: 
  solid;
border-width: 20px 5px; /* 20px top and bottom, 5px on the 
  sides */
}
p.three {
border-style: solid;
border-width: 25px 10px 
  4px 35px; /* 25px top, 10px right, 4px bottom and 35px left */
}
```
